 "conclusion":
 "Congratulations. You have evidence that your party will have cake!\n\n----\n1:\n```\nhave c := bakery_service p\nexact c\n```\n2:\n```\nexact bakery_service p\n```\n3:\n```\nexact modus_ponens bakery_service p\n```"}